  @relation(fields: [member_id], references: [id])\n131: //   date        String\n132: //   conditions  Json\n133: //   meals       Json\n134: //   note        String\n135: //   createdAt   DateTime @default(now())\n136: //   updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt\n137: // }\n138: \n139: model FoodItems {\n140:   id        String   @id @default(uuid())\n141:   name      String\n142:   calories  Int\n143:   recipe    String?\n144:   protein   Int? // grams\n145:   carbs     Int? // grams\n146:   fats      Int?\n147:   createdAt DateTime @default(now())\n148:   updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt\n149: }\n150: "}
{"step_index":48,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-23T23:32:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-23T16:32:26-07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-23T16:32:26-07:00\nShowing lines 1-78 of 78\n1: # VoltFit\n2: \n3: [![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)](LICENSE)\n4: [![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-18-61DAFB?logo=react&logoColor=white)](https://react.dev/)\n5: [![Vite](https://img.shields.io/badge/Vite-5-646CFF?logo=vite&logoColor=white)](https://vitejs.dev/)\n6: [![Tailwind CSS](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tailwind_CSS-3.4-38B2AC?logo=tailwind-css&logoColor=white)](https://tailwindcss.com/)\n7: \n8: An open-source **fitness club operations** dashboard UI built with React, Vite, and Tailwind CSS. Use it as a starter for multi-location gym/studio analytics, membership ops, and partner pipelines.\n9: \n10: ![VoltFit dashboard screenshot](docs/screenshot.png)\n11: \n12: ## Features\n13: \n14: - KPI cards for network metrics (clubs, operating spend, members, capacity, expiring plans)\n15: - Operating Spend chart with multi-period summaries\n16: - Club Map with franchise/owned pins and a detail popup\n17: - Upcoming Deadlines for trainer reviews and plan renewals\n18: - Top Revenue Clubs ranking and payments activity\n19: - Pages for Documents, Memberships, Studios, Partners, Support, Settings, and Team\n20: - Shared data contract in `src/data/dashboard.js` — swap stubs for real API data without touching components\n21: \n22: ## Tech Stack\n23: \n24: - [Vite 5](https://vitejs.dev/) + [React 18](https://react.dev/)\n25: - [Tailwind CSS 3.4](https://tailwindcss.com/)\n26: - [lucide-react](https://lucide.dev/) icons\n27: - [Inter](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter) via Google Fonts\n28: \n29: ## Getting Started\n30: \n31: **Requirements:** Node.js 18+ and npm\n32: \n33: ```bash\n34: git clone https://github.com/kendrekaran/voltfit-dashboard.git\n35: cd voltfit-dashboard\n36: npm install\n37: npm run dev\n38: ```\n39: \n40: Open the URL printed by Vite (default [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)).\n41: \n42: ## Scripts\n43: \n44: | Command           | Description                   |\n45: | ----------------- | ----------------------------- |\n46: | `npm run dev`     | Start the development server  |\n47: | `npm run build`   | Production build to `dist/`   |\n48: | `npm run preview` | Preview the production build  |\n49: \n50: ## Project Structure\n51: \n52: ```\n53: ├── index.html\n54: ├── src/\n55: │   ├── main.jsx\n56: │   ├── App.jsx                 # Shell + page routing\n57: │   ├── index.css               # Tailwind + design tokens\n58: │   ├── data/\n59: │   │   └── dashboard.js        # Shared mock data contract\n60: │   ├── components/             # Dashboard modules + UI primitives\n61: │   └── pages/                  # Route-level screens\n62: ├── docs/                       # Screenshot + design references\n63: ├── CONTRIBUTING.md\n64: ├── LICENSE\n65: └── package.json\n66: ```\n67: \n68: ## Customizing data\n69: \n70: All dashboard modules read from `src/data/dashboard.js`. Replace the stub arrays/objects with API responses and leave component signatures unchanged.\n71: \n72: ## Contributing\n73: \n74: See [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md). Fork, branch, and open a pull request — keep components prop-free and data centralized.\n75: \n76: ## License\n77: \n78: Released under the [MIT License](LICENSE)."}
